# component: progress
# decisions: API-41, API-42, DOC-1, DOC-2
# hunks:
#   API-42: `tone="success"` (`bg-success`) and `size` (`default` · `lg`) on the root and track.
#   API-41: `Progress` and `ProgressIndicator` take `tone` (`default` | `warning` | `danger`, written
#     as `data-tone`), and the indicator's fill moves into `progressIndicatorVariants`: `bg-primary`
#     stays the default, beside `bg-warning` and `bg-destructive`. `Progress` hands its tone to the
#     indicator it renders, so a caller never reaches for the lower-level parts to colour a bar.
#   NO OTHER STYLING HUNK. Progress has no interactive element at all — no focus, no cursor, no
#     disabled state — so no exception in the map reaches it. `transition-all` on the indicator
#     is upstream's (MOT rows resolve as **shadcn**), and the global reduced-motion reset (MOT-5)
#     neutralises it.
#   cn: `import { cn } from "cn"` becomes `@vegastack/design` — our npm layer owns `cn` (DOC-2).
#   formatting: the repository formatter (prettier defaults: semicolons, trailing commas)
#               reflows the file, and `registry-stamp.mjs` writes the provenance header the
#               three-copy model needs (DOC-1); those hunks carry no decision of their own.
